\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Actual Abaqus single-element geometry reconstructed from the input deck using the node coordinates and C3D8 element connectivity. The extracted model confirms the \(10~\mathrm  {mm}\times 2~\mathrm  {mm}\times 2~\mathrm  {mm}\) block, the left and right node sets, and the displacement-controlled cyclic loading direction.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
